{"meta":{"id":"e5ff2349-66bd-4358-b3e0-3936bb5ada5b","publication_id":"30c7e4c1-15ed-46d8-a23d-32c90e011794","web_title":"Hola Stellar: Intro a Soroban","parameterized_web_title":"hola-stellar-intro-a-soroban","utm_params_enabled":true,"utm_campaign":"hola-stellar-intro-a-soroban","utm_medium":"referral","utm_source":"blog.telluscoop.com","web_subtitle":"Creando un kickstarter con contratos inteligentes en Stellar","web_audiences":"free","status":"published","active":true,"featured":false,"override_scheduled_at":"2026-05-05T16:49:09.781Z","slug":"hola-stellar-intro-a-soroban","is_premium":false,"image_url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/55a9b19b-3cc1-480a-bd97-45e48469e5b3/HolaStelalr3_thumbnail.png?t=1775623910","image_width":1344,"image_height":754,"meta_default_title":"Stellar y Soroban: Contratos Inteligentes Explicados","meta_default_description":"Crea un kickstarter descentralizado con Soroban en Stellar: aprende smart contracts sin intermediarios. Transacciones rápidas, costos bajos y accesibles.","meta_og_title":"Stellar y Soroban: Contratos Inteligentes Explicados","meta_og_description":"Crea un kickstarter descentralizado con Soroban en Stellar: aprende smart contracts sin intermediarios. Transacciones rápidas, costos bajos y accesibles.","meta_twitter_title":"Stellar y Soroban: Contratos Inteligentes Explicados","meta_twitter_description":"Crea un kickstarter descentralizado con Soroban en Stellar: aprende smart contracts sin intermediarios. Transacciones rápidas, costos bajos y accesibles.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":null,"enforce_gated_content":false,"enable_popup_on_scroll":true,"email_capture_title":"Enjoying this post?","email_capture_message":"Subscribe to get more content like this delivered to your inbox for free!","email_capture_cta":"Subscribe","estimated_reading_time":3,"estimated_reading_time_display":"3 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"5a3c7fa0-8236-40e1-bd12-e2f5b6894278","name":"Joaquin Farfan","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/5a3c7fa0-8236-40e1-bd12-e2f5b6894278/pfp.jpg","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/5a3c7fa0-8236-40e1-bd12-e2f5b6894278/thumb_pfp.jpg"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/5a3c7fa0-8236-40e1-bd12-e2f5b6894278/landscape_pfp.jpg"}},"bio":"Web3 builder designing for humans and machines\nBuilding DeFi on Stellar","twitter_handle":"blessed_ux","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":"www.instagram.com/blessedux","linkedin_url":"","tiktok_url":"","youtube_url":null,"discord_url":"www.discord.com/blessedux","bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"58f0d587-3f53-4436-bedc-0f2e915190a0","display":"Blockchain","slug":"blockchain"},{"id":"ca4f9cd8-03f4-4baf-a2e0-d9f5ba3df073","display":"Cursos","slug":"cursos"}],"created_at":"2026-04-07T17:14:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T16:49:10Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"5a3c7fa0-8236-40e1-bd12-e2f5b6894278":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/joaquin-farfan"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"que-es-un-smart-contract\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Que es un smart contract?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>smart contract (contrato inteligente)</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es un programa que vive en una blockchain y que ejecuta automáticamente acuerdos cuando se cumplen ciertas condiciones.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En palabras simples: Es como un contrato digital que se cumple solo, sin necesidad de intermediarios.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Por ejemplo:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si alguin envía dinero → el contrato libera un producto o servicio</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si no se cumple una condición → el dinero se devuelve automáticamente</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Todo queda registrado de forma segura, transparente y no se puede modificar fácilmente.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La red de Stellar usa un lenguaje de programación específico para el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes llamado Soroban.</span></p></div><div id=\"porque-soroban-y-no-solidity\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Porque Soroban y no Solidity?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Soroban existe para llevar contratos inteligentes a la red de Stellar sin perder lo que hace especial a Stellar: transacciones rapidas, costos bajos y predecibles, enfoque en pagos globales y accesibilidad.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Solidity ha tenido muchos problemas historicos que han servido como casos de estudio durante el proceso de desarrollo de Soroban, Stellar quería un sistema más seguro desde la base.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Soroban </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">permite agregar contratos inteligentes a </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> manteniendo su enfoque en pagos rápidos y de bajo costo. A diferencia de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Solidity</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, Stellar utiliza </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Rust </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">para priorizar seguridad, eficiencia y mayor control, construyendo una infraestructura sólida desde la base pensada para aplicaciones financieras reales y escalables.</span></p></div><div id=\"open-zeppelin\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Open Zeppelin</span></h1></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>OpenZepplin </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">es importante porque ofrece contratos y herramientas preconstruidas, seguras y auditadas que ayudan a desarrollar smart contracts sin tener que empezar desde cero. En lugar de reinventar lógica crítica (como control de acceso, manejo de fondos o validaciones), puedes reutilizar estándares probados que reducen errores y vulnerabilidades. En simple: te permite construir más rápido, con mejores prácticas y con un nivel mucho mayor de seguridad, algo clave cuando estás manejando dinero en blockchain.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"tutorial-smart-contract-kickstarter\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Tutorial: Smart Contract Kickstarter en Soroban</strong></span></h1></div><div id=\"qu-vamos-a-construir\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Qué vamos a construir?</strong></span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un contrato inteligente donde:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un agricultor crea una campaña con meta de financiamiento</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Usuarios pueden aportar fondos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si se cumple la meta → agricultor retira fondos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si no → usuarios pueden retirar su dinero</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"paso-1-instalar-soroban-cli\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>⚙️ Paso 1: Instalar Soroban CLI</strong></span></h1></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Necesitas tener </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Rust</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> instalado primero:</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Luego instala Soroban CLI:</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>cargo install --locked soroban-cli</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Verifica instalación:</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>soroban --version</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"paso-2-crear-un-proyecto-soroban\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>📦 Paso 2: Crear un proyecto Soroban</strong></span></h1></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>soroban contract init kickstarter\ncd kickstarter</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esto crea la estructura base:</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>/src\n  lib.rs\nCargo.toml</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"paso-3-escribir-el-contrato-kicksta\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>✍️ Paso 3: Escribir el contrato (Kickstarter)</strong></span></h1></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Edita src/</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://lib.rs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">lib.rs</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> con el siguiente código auditado de OpenZeppelin:</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>#![no_std]\nuse soroban_sdk::{contract, contractimpl, Env, Symbol, Address, Map};\n\n#[contract]\npub struct KickstarterContract;\n\n#[derive(Clone)]\npub struct Campaign {\n    owner: Address,\n    goal: i128,\n    pledged: i128,\n    claimed: bool,\n}\n\n#[contractimpl]\nimpl KickstarterContract {\n\n    // Crear campaña\n    pub fn create_campaign(env: Env, owner: Address, goal: i128) {\n        let key = Symbol::new(<span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">&amp;</span>env, \"campaign\");\n        \n        let campaign = Campaign {\n            owner,\n            goal,\n            pledged: 0,\n            claimed: false,\n        };\n\n        env.storage().set(<span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">&amp;</span>key, <span style=\"color: #c9d1d9\">&amp;campaign);</span>\n    }\n\n    // Aportar fondos\n    pub fn pledge(env: Env, from: Address, amount: i128) {\n        let key = Symbol::new(<span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">&amp;</span>env, \"campaign\");\n        let mut campaign: Campaign = env.storage().get(<span style=\"color: #c9d1d9\">&amp;key).unwrap();</span>\n\n        campaign.pledged += amount;\n\n        env.storage().set(<span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">&amp;</span>key, <span style=\"color: #c9d1d9\">&amp;campaign);</span>\n    }\n\n    // Retirar fondos (si meta cumplida)\n    pub fn claim(env: Env, caller: Address) {\n        let key = Symbol::new(<span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">&amp;</span>env, \"campaign\");\n        let mut campaign: Campaign = env.storage().get(<span style=\"color: #c9d1d9\">&amp;key).unwrap();</span>\n\n        if campaign.pledged <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">&lt;</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">campaign.goal</span> <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">{</span>\n            <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">panic</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">!(\"</span><span style=\"color: #7ee787\">Meta</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">no</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">alcanzada</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">\");</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">}</span>\n\n        <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">if</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">campaign.owner</span> <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">!=</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">caller</span> <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">{</span>\n            <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">panic</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">!(\"</span><span style=\"color: #7ee787\">No</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">autorizado</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">\");</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">}</span>\n\n        <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">if</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">campaign.claimed</span> <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">{</span>\n            <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">panic</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">!(\"</span><span style=\"color: #7ee787\">Ya</span> <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">retirado</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">\");</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">}</span>\n\n        <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">campaign.claimed = </span><span style=\"color: #a5d6ff\">true;</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #7ee787\">env.storage</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">().</span><span style=\"color: #7ee787\">set</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">(&amp;</span><span style=\"color: #7ee787\">key</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color: #7ee787\">campaign</span><span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">);</span>\n    <span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">}</span>\n<span style=\"color: #f0f6fc;background-color: #8e1519\">}</span></code></pre></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"nota-estilo-open-zeppelin\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>🛡️ Nota estilo OpenZeppelin</strong></span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Estos son los principios de OZ que estamos usando en nuestro contrato:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">✅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Validaciones claras (panic!)</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">✅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Control de acceso (owner)</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">✅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Estado explícito (claimed)</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">✅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Lógica simple y auditable</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"paso-4-compilar-el-contrato\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>🛠️ Paso 4: Compilar el contrato</strong></span></h1></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>soroban contract build</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esto genera:</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/kickstarter.wasm</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"paso-5-crear-cuenta-en-testnet\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h1 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx2\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🌐</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Paso 5: Crear cuenta en Testnet</strong></span></h1></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Genera una nueva identidad con un nombre de ejemplo (alice) </span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>soroban config identity generate alice</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Obtén fondos (faucet):</span></p></div><div class=\"nrf06a0\"><div class=\"nrf06a1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nrf06a2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><!--$--><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"stroke-width:2\"><title>copy</title><use href=\"/phosphor-icons-sprite.svg#copy\"></use></svg><!--/$--></button><pre class=\"nrf06a3 nrf06a4\"><code>soroban config identity fund alice